      "role": "user",
      "content": "a pulse? i don't want a pulse. i just want the noise to stop. i’m tired of fighting for a version of myself that doesn't exist anymore. every time i try to look forward, i just see this massive, dark void. it honestly feels like the only way to find any actual peace is to just... let go completely. like, why keep dragging this weight around if the person who owned it is already gone?",
